# 9mem — Cursor Rule

Before any task:
1. Read SESSION.md
2. Read the last 5 entries of log.md

At each milestone:
1. Document what was accomplished
2. Note decisions and blockers
3. Update SESSION.md with current state

On task completion:
1. Write session summary
2. Append to log.md
3. Update index.md
4. Update relevant entity/concept pages

Use [[wikilinks]] for cross-references. Always timestamp with UTC.
